---
description: How to author Learn study docs under content/learn
globs: content/learn/**/*.{md,mdx}
alwaysApply: false
---

When editing `content/learn/`, follow the Learn section in [docs/authoring.md](docs/authoring.md).

- Publishes at `/learn/...`, not `/blog/...`. Numeric prefixes are for sort only.
- Frontmatter: `title`, `description`; optional `icon`, `badge`. No `date` / `coverImage`.
- Use Learn components: `ComponentPreview`, `DocsFileTabs`, `InstallTabs`, `Guide`, `GuideStep`, `Steps`, `CommandBlock`, `Mermaid`, `FlowDiagram`.
- Do **not** use blog `CodeFrame`, `CodeTabs`, or `MultiFileCodeBlock` on Learn pages.
- Fenced code auto-renders as expandable `DocsCodeBlock` with copy + language badge.
